{"id":"n75753-1-9","stage":1,"title":"입술 · 嘴唇","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75753-1-9-1","ko":"아기 입술 모양이 참 예쁘네.","zh":"宝宝的嘴唇形状真漂亮啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아기","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"1","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입술","meaning":"嘴唇","explanation":"입술：嘴唇","readings":[{"term":"입술","audio":"/audio/94eae6bfefacd134dec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75753","senseId":"1","lemma":"입술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모양이","meaning":"样子，形状","explanation":"모양：样子，形状；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"모양","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62397","senseId":"5","lemma":"모양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예쁘네.","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d5fa7c0faafdc9fc","term":"아기","zh":"小孩，婴儿","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3","entryId":"20235","definition":"吃着奶的非常幼小的孩子。","pronunciation":["아기"]},{"id":"94eae6bfefacd134","term":"입술","zh":"嘴唇","audio":"/audio/94eae6bfefacd134dec5.mp3","entryId":"75753","definition":"围绕人的嘴周围的又红又软的肉。","pronunciation":["입쑬"]},{"id":"f1cd655a5837981f","term":"모양","zh":"样子，形状","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3","entryId":"62397","definition":"与某物相同或相似的模样。","pronunciation":["모양"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/40ed299277e66edea076.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75753-1-9-2","ko":"그러게요. 정말 앵두 같은 입술이네요.","zh":"是啊，简直就像樱桃一样的嘴唇呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게요.","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앵두","meaning":"樱桃","explanation":"앵두：樱桃","readings":[{"term":"앵두","audio":"/audio/5968e19b67953597d140.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66738","senseId":"1","lemma":"앵두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같은","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입술이네요.","meaning":"嘴唇","explanation":"입술：嘴唇；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"입술","audio":"/audio/94eae6bfefacd134dec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75753","senseId":"1","lemma":"입술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"5968e19b67953597","term":"앵두","zh":"樱桃","